          <aside class="aeo-answer">
            Wainscoting installation in Delaware County ranges from $8–$30+ per linear foot depending on type, substrate, and profile matching. A typical hallway runs $1,500–$3,500 all-in. Historic plaster-wall installations require specialized prep. ProBrothers serves Media, Newtown Square, Haverford, Springfield, Kennett Square, and surrounding communities.
